{"seq":2,"slug":"eta-prediction","title":"配送时效预估模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/tracking-eta/eta-prediction","wordCount":2862,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"配送时效预估模型\">配送时效预估模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「预计 9 月 30 日送达」这句话在电商页面上只有十几个字，但它背后是一个从下单那一刻起就要持续更新的预测：随着包裹在链路中推进、随着实际事件的时间与预期偏离、随着运营状况变化，这个预测要不断修正，而且<strong>修正本身也会被用户看到</strong>。时效预估（ETA, estimated time of arrival）的工程难点不在于「预测一个日期」，而在于预测会随着新信息不断变化，而用户对变化的容忍度很低。</p>\n<p>先明确预估的输出形状。一个日期点估计是最差的输出，因为它既无法表达不确定性，也无法用于服务水平判断。正确的输出是一对<strong>分位数</strong>，或一个离散化的到达时间分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>到达时间</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>当前状态</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>线路</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>承运商</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>历史</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{F}(t) = P(\\text{到达时间} \\le t \\mid \\text{当前状态}, \\text{线路}, \\text{承运商}, \\text{历史})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到达时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当前状态</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">线路</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">承运商</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">历史</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用户看到的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{F}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的某个分位数（例如「预计 9 月 30 日」对应 P50，「可能延迟到 10 月 3 日」对应 P90），而系统校验承诺用的是另一个分位数。用分布而不是点估计有三个直接的好处：<strong>（1）</strong> 可以显式管理承诺（承诺用高置信分位数，展示用中位数）；<strong>（2）</strong> 可以量化「不确定」并在不确定时收窄承诺（如从具体日期改为日期区间）；<strong>（3）</strong> 可以度量模型质量（不能只问「准不准」，要问「P50 是否真的落在中位数」）。</p>\n<p>本文与相邻主题的边界：<strong>输入事件的来源与净化</strong>在 <a href=\"tracking-aggregation\">多承运商轨迹归一化聚合</a>；<strong>预估结果如何变成通知与告警</strong>在 <a href=\"tracking-event-push\">轨迹事件推送与异常预警</a>；<strong>预估如何在选仓与选承运商时被消费</strong>在 <a href=\"../carrier-routing/warehouse-selection\">分仓选择与履约成本路由</a> 与 <a href=\"../carrier-routing/carrier-abstraction\">多承运商接入抽象与比价</a>；<strong>预估质量如何进入监控</strong>在 <a href=\"../reverse-global/fulfillment-observability\">履约时效/妥投率监控</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;订单创建&lt;br/&gt;无轨迹&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;静态预估&lt;br/&gt;线路基线 + 承运商基线&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;已揽收&lt;br/&gt;有 ACCEPTED 事件&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;段内推进预估&lt;br/&gt;剩余段时长分布&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;是否接近&lt;br/&gt;段边界&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[&quot;段边界修正&lt;br/&gt;交接历史时长&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;保持当前预估&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;清关风险调整&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;输出分位数&lt;br/&gt;P50 / P90&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;对外展示&lt;br/&gt;+ 承诺校验&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K[&quot;实际签收事件&quot;]&#10;    K --&gt; L[&quot;误差归因&lt;br/&gt;哪一段偏了&quot;]&#10;    L --&gt; M[&quot;模型与基线更新&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; B\">graph TD\n    A[\"订单创建&lt;br/&gt;无轨迹\"] --&gt; B[\"静态预估&lt;br/&gt;线路基线 + 承运商基线\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"已揽收&lt;br/&gt;有 ACCEPTED 事件\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"段内推进预估&lt;br/&gt;剩余段时长分布\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"是否接近&lt;br/&gt;段边界\"}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[\"段边界修正&lt;br/&gt;交接历史时长\"]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[\"保持当前预估\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"清关风险调整\"]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[\"输出分位数&lt;br/&gt;P50 / P90\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"对外展示&lt;br/&gt;+ 承诺校验\"]\n    J --&gt; K[\"实际签收事件\"]\n    K --&gt; L[\"误差归因&lt;br/&gt;哪一段偏了\"]\n    L --&gt; M[\"模型与基线更新\"]\n    M --&gt; B</pre><p>图中 <code>A → B</code> 的静态预估常被忽略，但它是<strong>覆盖率最高的一段</strong>：大量订单在创建后的头几个小时里没有任何轨迹，如果这段不给预估（或给一个粗糙的全局常数），用户就会看到「待发货，无预计时间」。静态预估的质量直接决定用户对系统的第一印象。而 <code>L</code>（误差归因）是模型迭代的关键——见下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静态预估-无轨迹时的预估\">静态预估：无轨迹时的预估</h2><p>下单时系统可能有：收货地址、发货仓、选定的承运商与服务水平、商品属性（含电池会走特殊通道）、当前时间。没有轨迹。此时的预估只能基于<strong>历史基线的组合</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>static</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>handling</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>linehaul</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>customs</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lastmile</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_{\\text{static}} = T_{\\text{handling}}(w) + T_{\\text{linehaul}}(w, d, i) + T_{\\text{customs}}(d, g) + T_{\\text{lastmile}}(d_i, d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">static</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">handling</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">linehaul</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">customs</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lastmile</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四项分别对应仓内作业时间、干线时长、清关时长、尾程时长；其中清关项在跨境场景下权重很大且方差极大。这个分解的价值在于<strong>每一项都有独立的历史数据可估</strong>，且每一项都可以被业务优化（仓内作业可以改善、清关方式可以换、尾程承运商可以换）。相比之下，直接用「全局平均 7 天」这种单参数模型，无法回答「为什么这个订单预估 12 天」。</p>\n<p>四个分量的组合不是简单相加。到达时间的分布是各段分布的和（假设段之间近似独立），所以：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = \\sum_k \\mu_k, \\qquad \\sigma^2 \\approx \\sum_k \\sigma_k^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个近似在实践中有个重要含义：<strong>总方差远大于任一分量的方差</strong>，且各分量的方差是相加的。这意味着要显著收窄预估的不确定性，必须改善<strong>方差最大</strong>的那一段，而不是改善均值最大的那一段。跨境场景下方差最大的几乎总是清关，这也是为什么「优化清关」对预估准确度的收益远高于「优化干线速度」——后者主要改善均值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态修正-事件驱动的预估更新\">动态修正：事件驱动的预估更新</h2><p>一旦有了轨迹事件，预估从「静态基线」切换到「已实现 + 剩余预测」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>dynamic</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>remaining</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mtext>elapsed</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>status</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_{\\text{dynamic}}(t) = t_{\\text{now}} + \\sum_{k \\in \\text{remaining}} \\hat{T}_k \\;\\big|\\; \\text{elapsed}_k, \\text{status}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2329em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dynamic</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">remaining</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">elapsed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">status</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于「已实现的段」提供了<strong>校准信号</strong>。如果头程实际用了 30 小时而基线是 12 小时，那么后续段虽然不受直接影响，但<strong>这次运输整体偏慢的信号</strong>应该被纳入——这就是特征工程里最重要的部分：<strong>相对进度</strong>（relative progress）而非绝对时间。</p>\n<p>定义相对进度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>elapsed</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k = \\frac{\\text{elapsed}_k}{\\hat{\\mu}_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2519em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">elapsed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示这一段比预期慢。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为特征，模型可以学到「头程慢 1.5 倍的订单，全程平均慢多少」——这个关系不是必然为正（可能被后续赶回），但通常显著。这比直接使用绝对时间好得多，因为它自动适应了不同线路的不同时间尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>段边界事件是最强的信号。</strong> 到达枢纽、出口放行、进口放行这些事件把「已经过去的时间」切成了有语义的块，每块可独立比对基线。因此在预估模型里，段边界事件应该被给予远高于普通中间事件的权重，或者干脆为每个段单独建模剩余时长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型选择-从查表到学习\">模型选择：从查表到学习</h2><p>时效预估的模型谱系按复杂度递增，实践中往往是<strong>分层组合</strong>而非单选：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分位数查表</td>\n<td>冷启动、长尾线路</td>\n<td>无训练成本、可解释</td>\n<td>无法利用事件序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生存分析 / AFT</td>\n<td>有事件但样本中等</td>\n<td>天然处理删失（未签收样本）</td>\n<td>特征表达能力有限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>梯度提升（GBDT）</td>\n<td>主流，样本充足</td>\n<td>特征灵活、效果好</td>\n<td>需特征工程与定期重训</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列模型（RNN/Transformer）</td>\n<td>事件序列长、模式复杂</td>\n<td>自动学序列模式</td>\n<td>数据要求高、可解释性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段叠加</td>\n<td>有清晰段划分（跨境常见）</td>\n<td>每段可独立优化与解释</td>\n<td>段间独立性假设不总成立</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>跨境场景强烈推荐「分段叠加 + 段内 GBDT」<strong>的组合。理由不是效果最优，而是</strong>可运维</strong>：当预估出现系统性偏差时，你能立刻定位到是哪一段偏了、那一段的基线该更新了、还是那一段的模型退化了。相比之下，一个端到端的序列模型在偏差出现时只能整体重训，且无法向业务解释原因。</p>\n<p><strong>删失（censoring）是这里最容易被忽视的统计问题。</strong> 训练数据里有一部分包裹至今未签收（尤其是慢单）。如果把未签收样本直接丢弃，模型会系统性低估时长（因为慢的单子被丢掉了）；如果把它们当作「未到达」以外的值处理，则是错误的。正确做法是用生存分析的框架处理删失，或在 GBDT 里用<strong>分位数目标函数</strong>（quantile loss）并正确处理未完成样本。（生存分析处理右删失的经典非参数方法是 Kaplan–Meier 乘积限估计，由 Edward L. Kaplan 与 Paul Meier 提出，论文发表于 1958 年 JASA；来源：Wikipedia, Kaplan–Meier estimator, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaplan%E2%80%93Meier_estimator\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaplan%E2%80%93Meier_estimator</a> ）这个坑在模型上线半年后才会显现为「预估持续偏乐观」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预估的评估-不能只看平均误差\">预估的评估：不能只看平均误差</h2><p>评估时效预估有四个层次，缺一个都会留下盲区：</p>\n<p><strong>校准性（calibration）。</strong> 你给出的 P90 是否真的覆盖 90% 的实际到达？把预估值分桶，检查每桶的实际命中率是否接近名义分位数。校准失败比误差大更严重——它意味着承诺没有依据。</p>\n<p><strong>排序性（discrimination）。</strong> 能否区分快单与慢单？用实际到达时间与预测的秩相关（如 Spearman）度量。一个把所有订单都预测为「7 天」的模型平均误差可能很小，但排序性为零，对用户毫无价值。</p>\n<p><strong>分段归因（attribution）。</strong> 误差发生在哪一段？把总误差分解到各段，才能指导优化。分解方式是比对各段实际时长与基线的偏差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Error</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>actual</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Error} = \\sum_k \\big( \\text{actual}_k - \\hat{\\mu}_k \\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Error</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">actual</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>哪一项最大，优化就该落在哪里。</p>\n<p><strong>业务影响（impact）。</strong> 预估误差是否影响转化与投诉？通常可以观测到：展示更宽区间（承认不确定）会略微降低转化但显著降低未达承诺的投诉；展示过于乐观的点估计会提升短期转化并制造大量投诉。这个权衡必须由业务显式决策，而不是由算法「顺手优化转化」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"承诺与展示的分层\">承诺与展示的分层</h2><p>最后是产品层的关键设计：<strong>承诺（commitment）与展示（display）应该使用不同的分位数，且它们是两个不同的系统</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>分位数</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n<th>设计要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>页面展示</td>\n<td>P50 附近，或区间</td>\n<td>用户预期偏差</td>\n<td>尽量具体，区间不宜过宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺（赔付/退款依据）</td>\n<td>P90 或 P95</td>\n<td>真金白银赔付</td>\n<td>保守、宁宽勿窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选仓与选承运商</td>\n<td>P90</td>\n<td>路由决策次优</td>\n<td>与承诺口径一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运营预警</td>\n<td>尾部或偏离基线</td>\n<td>告警噪音或漏报</td>\n<td>与展示脱钩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>这四个口径不应使用同一个数字。</strong> 一个常见的错误是用页面展示的日期作为赔付依据，结果每遇大规模延误就赔付激增。工程上要求承诺分位数是一个显式配置，且当模型无法给出可靠分位数（如新线路冷启动）时应<strong>退化到区间展示而非精确日期</strong>，宁可说「9 月 29 日至 10 月 4 日」也不要给一个会被打破的具体日期。（承诺还有法定义务的边界：美国 FTC 的 Mail, Internet, or Telephone Order Merchandise Rule 规定，卖家若未明确承诺发货时间，默认须在收到订单后 30 天内发货；无法按期时必须主动通知并提供「同意延期或全额退款」的选择；来源：FTC, <a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/business-guide-ftcs-mail-internet-or-telephone-order-merchandise-rule\">https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/business-guide-ftcs-mail-internet-or-telephone-order-merchandise-rule</a> ）</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预估的输出是到达时间分布的分位数而非点估计；分布使承诺、展示、路由、告警能用不同口径。</li>\n<li>静态预估（无轨迹）必须存在且要四段分解（仓内、干线、清关、尾程），因为每段可独立估计与优化。</li>\n<li>总方差是各段方差之和：改善准确度应优先降低方差最大的段（跨境几乎总是清关）。</li>\n<li>动态修正的关键特征是<strong>相对进度</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非绝对时间；段边界事件权重最高。</li>\n<li>推荐「分段叠加 + 段内 GBDT」：效果接近最优且可归因、可运维；训练必须处理删失，否则会系统性偏乐观。</li>\n<li>评估四层：校准性、排序性、分段归因、业务影响；缺少任一层都会留下盲区。</li>\n<li>承诺、展示、路由、告警四个分位数口径必须分离；冷启动时退化为区间而非精确日期。</li>\n<li>输入见 <a href=\"tracking-aggregation\">多承运商轨迹归一化聚合</a>，输出见 <a href=\"tracking-event-push\">轨迹事件推送与异常预警</a>，预估如何在选路时被消费见 <a href=\"../carrier-routing/carrier-abstraction\">多承运商接入抽象与比价</a>，质量监控见 <a href=\"../reverse-global/fulfillment-observability\">履约时效/妥投率监控</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"配送时效预估模型","id":"配送时效预估模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"静态预估：无轨迹时的预估","id":"静态预估-无轨迹时的预估"},{"level":2,"text":"动态修正：事件驱动的预估更新","id":"动态修正-事件驱动的预估更新"},{"level":2,"text":"模型选择：从查表到学习","id":"模型选择-从查表到学习"},{"level":2,"text":"预估的评估：不能只看平均误差","id":"预估的评估-不能只看平均误差"},{"level":2,"text":"承诺与展示的分层","id":"承诺与展示的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多承运商轨迹归一化聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/tracking-eta/tracking-aggregation"},"next":{"title":"轨迹事件推送与异常预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fulfillment-delivery-engineering/tracking-eta/tracking-event-push"}}